WEEK 5 — ONLINE PAYMENTS WITH RAZORPAY

Date: Monday, 7 September 2026

Problem: A success message in the browser can be faked, and a double tap on Pay could create two bills.

Solution:
- Verified every payment on the server using the Razorpay signature.
- Recomputed HMAC-SHA256(order_id | payment_id) and compared it in constant time.
- Saved the bill only when the signatures match, otherwise no invoice is issued.
- Made verification idempotent, so a repeated request returns the same receipt.
- Added a mock gateway that signs payments locally, so testing works without keys.
